Z||000006||Cooter||01-24-2000||10:10 PM||||I have heard: I bet that thing rides like a wagon. <BR>I've seen those pieces of **** fall apart in wrecks. (Well have you seen a new camaro/firebird???)<BR>My (insert relative here) had one of those cars. It stayed in the shop more than he/she drove it.<BR>How could you control that thing on a windy day?||||reg||1
Z||000007||stimpy||01-24-2000||10:10 PM||||The highway patrolman who stopped for me after I blew up my motor at 137k miles on a 700 mile round trip averaging 80+mph in 100 degree weather..."those things had a lot of reliability problems"... come on guy, 137k miles!!! ever see a cop car after 60k miles? all right then.||||reg||1
Z||000008||87GT||01-24-2000||10:22 PM||||I have heard some, here they are.<BR>1.) Dont get in a wreck with one of them!<BR>2.) They explode when rear-ended<BR>3.) Its a Pontiac<BR>4.) Fiero, GM's version of the Pinto(Discount     Auto employee said that)<BR>5.) Shit for cars<BR>6.) They get hung up under semis.  <P>Well those are just a few.  I have heard them a hundred times.  I dont give a damn what people think, I just know I feel cool when I am driving mine down the road. 8-)||||reg||1
