Z||000012||DJRice||01-25-2000||09:30 AM||||From Discount Auto Parts Employees after asking for any part for the car:<P>"I had a friend who had one of those, He had to use starting fluid every day to start it.  Once he got it going it ran fine tho."<P>"Better you than me workin' on that little SOB."<P>-from a newbie employee- "Is it true that you have to drop the engine to change the spark plugs?"  <P>My answer was "only if you've got the V6"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>This one came from a local auto shop that I will never visit again:<P>"Fiero?  Oh the guys really hate to see those things come in."<P>(Why is that, cuz my car is so much nicer than any of the other cars in the parking lot?)<P>And from the general population:<BR>"My aunt's cousin's brother's roomate knows a guy who saw one spontaneously burst into flames."<BR>||||reg||1
