Z||000017||ggarsk||01-25-2000||07:47 PM||||Here's some:<BR> They burn up fusible links all the time.<BR> How can you drive with your a** so close to the ground.<BR>Where's the motor?<BR> They are so unsafe.<BR> It's to small,my feet don't fit the pedals.<BR> I don't like them.<BR> It's to hard to find parts for them.<BR>And the list goes on...and on...kind of like that bunnie.||||reg||1
