Z||000023||86SE||01-25-2000||10:54 PM||||"That thing is loud!!!"<P>Thats about the only thing I hear around here, they all just keep their mouth shut and stare at it.  Then I slowly creep up next to thier cars and turn so they can see down my dual chrome ANSA exhaust tips as they breath fire as I take off.||||reg||1
Z||000024||WKDFIRO||01-26-2000||12:22 AM||||Thanks for the input guys this is really funny. I love when they tell me that my entire car is fiberglass. I blow them away by asking them if they can do THIS to fiberglass, and give the door a mighty kick. Previous owner of my car had a super cheap paint job on it so I am not really that concerned about my paint but it sure gets their attention.Oh my contribution:<P>This guy had just come to the shop on a rainy day. He got out and started putting rags on the vents. We looked at him and asked him what he was doing. <P>He said that the previous owner said that he had to cover the vents to keep water from getting into the engine.||||reg||10
Z||000025||WKDFIRO||01-26-2000||12:31 AM||||Oh, another one somebody told me on the internet:<P>"The 88s were the fastest because they took out the Mass Air Flow sensor." (HUH?)||||reg||1
