Z||000027||fierosound||01-26-2000||09:01 PM||||For those who think "it's a small "plastic" car, it doesn't hold up in an accident".<BR> <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.ezl.com/~bpape/old/fiero/fiero_e.jpg">    <P>This picture gives some indication that Fiero is solidly built - most cars crush under their own weight when they roll over! People don't realize the Fiero came in second behind Volvo when crash tested for occupant safety.<P>This interesting Fiero photo is at this website:  <BR><A HREF="http://www.ezl.com/~bpape/old/fiero/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ezl.com/~bpape/old/fiero/</A>   <BR><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 01-27-2000).]||||reg||10
