Z||000033||Dan86gt3.8||01-27-2000||12:34 PM||||man that pic brings back some memories!  I did the same thing in my wreck but the car went off to the right(pasenger) side.  For a second I thought she was gona come down right on top of me like that but she went off to the right side.  Its like the frontof the car is a pitch fork when you rearend some one, it was raining and a lady poulled into my lane going downhill, needles to say the brakes locked up imediately and I began to slide.  <P>Well my personal favorite is<BR>guy: "you know its almost instant death if you get hit in the rear"<BR>me: "ohh really"<BR>guy: "ya the engine goes right up into the passenger compartment and will blow up"<BR>9this came from a guy driving adodge daytona<BR>(which if I rember correctly was one of the most unsafe cars ever)(correct me if I am wrong)<P>other favorites "is you know it'll probably catch on fire some day"<BR>"like ohh my god what is that thing?"(this has come from 13-16 year olds some of them are my sisters friends!)<P>but my personal favorite is when you roast a redneck in there big inbred truck, and they pull upand say "I don't know what that thing is man , but itll sh*tn'get"||||reg||6
